<p>The <code>__construct</code> method uses the <code>authorizeResource</code> method to automatically authorize resource controller methods. We&#x27;ve also added a <code>publish</code> method with a manual authorization check.</p>
<p>Alternatively, you can use the <code>authorize</code> method within each controller method to perform authorization checks manually. This method takes the name of the policy method to call and the model to authorize against:</p>
