</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Eager Loading</strong>: When fetching users with their roles and permissions, use eager loading:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="php"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">$users </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> User</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">::</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">with</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">(</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">&#x27;roles&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">,</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;permissions&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">)</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">-&gt;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">get</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">()</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.9